<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>08 / 教学协同 Agent</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>跨角色协同链路与隐私边界</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E7BE0' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>设计中</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 18 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={1140} height={180} viewBox='0 0 1140 180'><rect x='0' y='40' width='191' height='88' rx='8' fill='#0E2340' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='95.5' y='78.0' font-size='20' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>学生练习反复受阻</text><text x='95.5' y='104.0' font-size='15' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>形成目标步骤与作答证据</text><line x1='197' y1='84' x2='223' y2='84' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M223 78 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='237' y='40' width='191' height='88' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='332.5' y='78.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>生成供教师查看的摘要</text><text x='332.5' y='104.0' font-size='15' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>含已尝试支持与待核实问题</text><line x1='434' y1='84' x2='460' y2='84' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M460 78 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='474' y='40' width='191' height='88' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='569.5' y='78.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>教师安排补练</text><text x='569.5' y='104.0' font-size='15' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>落实为具体任务</text><line x1='671' y1='84' x2='697' y2='84' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M697 78 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='711' y='40' width='191' height='88' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='806.5' y='78.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>学生助教在预算内跟进</text><text x='806.5' y='104.0' font-size='15' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>读取任务并复测</text><line x1='908' y1='84' x2='934' y2='84' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M934 78 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='948' y='40' width='191' height='88' rx='8' fill='#F5F7FA' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='1043.5' y='78.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>学校查看经允许的汇总</text><text x='1043.5' y='104.0' font-size='15' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>不展开个人对话</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F5F7FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #00A9B5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>隐私：个人对话内容不因角色协同就全部共享；对教师保留教学所需证据，对学校按职责提供汇总或必要明细。首期仅使用系统内任务与教师可见摘要，外部通知需单独接入与配置授权</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：教学协同Agent设计.md §7–§8</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 83 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>